--TEST--
A `get` or `set` hook on a `static` property is `E0872` at the first hook, and the same hook on an instance property compiles
--FILE--
<?nvs
class Counter {
    public static int $count { get => 3; }

    public int $size { get => 4; }
}

echo (new Counter())->size, "\n";
--EXPECT--

--EXPECTF-ERROR--
error[E0872]: a `static` property cannot have a `get` or `set` hook
%A
error: aborting due to 1 error
To read what a code means and how to fix it, run `nvs agent show <code>`.
